2026-11-03 09:53:02,271 [c6721f0c7a32] server feedback.done {"mistakes": [{"you_said": "我今天很好。", "correction": "我今天很好。/ 我很好。", "correction_pinyin": "Wǒ jīntiān hěn hǎo. / Wǒ hěn hǎo.", "explanation": "This is understandable, but when answering \"how are you\" Chinese usually just says 我很好. Adding 今天 is fine, but it sounds a bit unnatural here.", "category": "word_choice"}, {"you_said": "我今天没会见老师,没有课。", "correction": "我今天不见老师,没有课。", "correction_pinyin": "Wǒ jīntiān bù jiàn lǎoshī, méiyǒu kè.", "explanation": "没 goes before a verb to say it didn't happen, and 会 is not needed. To say you are not going to do something today, use 不 + verb: 不见老师.", "category": "grammar"}, {"you_said": "我在图书馆。我在家不能学", "correction": "我在图书馆学习。我在家不能学习。", "correction_pinyin": "Wǒ zài túshūguǎn xuéxí. Wǒ zài jiā bù néng xuéxí.", "explanation": "学 usually needs an object like 习 or 汉语 (学习 / 学汉语). Also 在图书馆 here sounds like you are currently there, so adding the verb 学习 makes the meaning clear.", "category": "missing_word"}, {"you_said": "我应该学计算机。", "correction": "我应该学电脑。", "correction_pinyin": "Wǒ yīnggāi xué diànnǎo.", "explanation": "学计算机 is possible but a bit advanced. At HSK 2, 电脑 is more common. Also 学 with a subject works, but 学习电脑 may sound more natural for \"study computers\".", "category": "word_choice"}], "possible_mishearings": [{"transcribed": "我姓商", "probably_said": "我姓尤 / 我姓 (another surname)", "pronunciation_tip": "Surname may have been misheard; say it slowly and clearly, e.g. \"我姓尤\" (yóu)."}, {"transcribed": "验证的意思是什么?", "probably_said": "安静的意思是什么?", "pronunciation_tip": "安静 (ānjìng) was probably heard as 验证 (yànzhèng). Practice the first tone ān and the \"jìng\" ending."}, {"transcribed": "我叫尤泰。", "probably_said": "我叫尤泰 (Uthai)", "pronunciation_tip": ""}], "praise": "You kept the conversation going well, giving reasons (no class, need to study) and even asking the tutor a question."}
